'''Starlyn Contests''' are an [[Events|event]] that take place every [[SkyBlock Day]] and last for {{Green|20}} real life minutes. During this event, players collect points by chopping trees, collecting island resources, and [[Hunting]] various creatures on the {{Zone|Moonglade Marsh}} and/or {{Zone|Torrhus Canyon}}.

== Moonglade Marsh Contests ==
'''Agatha's Contests''' take place on the {{Zone|Moonglade Marsh}}, the first island of {{Zone|Galatea}}. They are hosted by {{NPCSprite|Agatha}}, who can be found in the center of the island. To speak to her, the player must have finished speaking to {{NPCSprite|Swoop}} to learn about {{Stat|Sweep}} and [[Tree Gifts]], {{NPCSprite|David Hunterborough}} to learn about {{Skill|Hunting}}, and {{NPCSprite|Kysha}} to learn about [[Attribute Fusion]].

