=== Rewards ===
There are {{Green|5}} main reward brackets and {{Green|3}} hidden ones, each corresponding to a rarity. Each bracket grants better rewards than the previous and depends on how many points were earned.

Additionally, the first {{Green|3}} contests of each real-life day reward {{Green|1,200}} [[Heart of the Forest]] XP. This is replaced by {{Green|1,200}} {{Forest Whispers}} at '''HotF Level''' {{Green|8}}.

Reaching the {{Epic}} bracket grants a {{Green|10%}} chance to get a {{Item|Agatha's Prize}}, while reaching the {{Legendary}} bracket or above grants a {{Green|20%}} chance to get a {{Item|Agatha's Prize}}.

