== Notes ==
*The {{Skill|Foraging}} XP gained is not affected by {{stat|Foraging Wisdom}}. It is also not affected by XP boosts caused by the [[SkyBlock Anniversary]] or [[Century Celebration]].

== Tips ==
*For Moonglade Marsh Contest, with the {{Attr|Berry Enjoyer X}} attribute, obtained from {{Item|Bullfrog Shard}}s, and harvesting {{Item|Lushlilac}} bushes and catching any {{MobSprite|Birries}} that spawn, players can easily get high brackets from the event, without needing expensive setups or dedicating too much time to the event.
**Note that additional {{Item|Lushlilac}} and {{Item|Sea Lumies}} from the {{Attr|Yummy}} attribute will not count for point gains.
*For Torrhus Canyon Contest, diving into the {{Zone|Torrhus Springs}} to hunt {{MobSprite|Solar}}, {{MobSprite|Ember}} and harvest {{Item|Ruby Veilshroom}} in the air pockets to the side, players can easily get high brackets.
**A decent amount of {{Statname|pressure resistance}} is required to be able to reach the third {{Item|Ruby Veilshroom}} cave and to more reliably hunt the {{MobSprite|Ember}}.
*Additional logs from {{Statname|Foraging Fortune}} will count toward the 100 logs requirement to gain points for logs.

== Trivia ==
*Points from {{Green|Hunting Creatures}} are gained per mob instead of per shard, meaning {{Stat|hunting fortune}} does not affect point gain.
*Unlike [[Jacob's Farming Contest|Jacob's Contests]], servers can restart during '''Starlyn Contests'''.

